[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4437773663","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111239#issuecomment-4437773663","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111239","id":4437773663,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCIMNXw","user":{"login":"codespren","id":17741903,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQxOTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17741903?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codespren","html_url":"https://github.com/codespren","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codespren/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codespren/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codespren/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codespren/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codespren/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codespren/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codespren/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codespren/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codespren/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-13T05:52:20Z","updated_at":"2026-05-13T05:52:20Z","body":"I can confirm that this bug still exists with Godot version 4.6.2 Mono stable.\n\nI am personally using external editor but occasionally I open source files inside the Godot editor and randomly the source file opened in Godot gets replaced with an old version.\n\nToday I accidentally opened one of the source files in Godot editor and tried to run the game after that and the file was replaced with a version from yesterday. I had restarted Godot this morning so the source file that is coming from the cache is saved to the file system and not only to the memory.\n\nThe bug happens randomly, haven't been able to make reproduce steps. I too have a hunch that this happens more often when the project gets larger.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4437773663/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4651510022","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111239#issuecomment-4651510022","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111239","id":4651510022,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFUBpBg","user":{"login":"SeremTitus","id":58259212,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MjU5MjEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58259212?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus","html_url":"https://github.com/SeremTitus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SeremTitus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T17:14:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T17:14:40Z","body":"Stumble to this concerning bug in Godot v4.7.beta3, for me if I move out Godot without saving and come back my code is reverted","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4651510022/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,